<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">08072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Explosions struck three cities across southern Iran overnight, as the United States resumed direct strikes it says answer Tehran's firing on commercial ships near the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>After months of managed brinkmanship, a single maritime incident, not the nuclear file, has reopened open warfare.</s> <s>Talks stay frozen until Ayatollah Khamenei's burial concludes, leaving a sixty-day ceasefire hanging by a thread.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Two bombings tore through Damascus this week, one killing nine people, most of them lawyers, the other wounding eighteen near the hotel of visiting French President Emmanuel Macron.</s> <s>Macron became the first major Western leader to reach Syria since Bashar al-Assad's fall, meeting the new president Ahmed al-Sharaa only hours after the blast.</s> <s>No group has claimed the attacks, and every dollar of the two hundred billion the country needs to rebuild stays hostage to that silence.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At the annual pledging conference for the United Nations refugee agency, the American ambassador urged donor states to send their money instead to an Israeli-backed body called the Board of Peace.</s> <s>That agency registers one point four million Palestinian refugees in Gaza alone, running the schools, clinics, and food rations a rival body has no mandate to replace.</s> <s>Secretary-General Guterres warned that starving one agency of cash while standing up another is how a refugee mandate gets dismantled by budget rather than by vote.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Police in Trinidad and Tobago searched taxis and blocked a march marking the island's nineteen thirty-seven labour uprising.</s> <s>Officers leaned on a state of emergency declared in December twenty twenty-four to fight gang violence, turning colonial-era emergency powers against a protest about police power itself.</s> <s>Organizers now plan a twentieth demonstration over the January police shooting of Joshua Samaroo, with no legal reckoning yet in sight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's anti-corruption commission has filed six criminal counts against former minister Uche Nnaji, accusing him of forging a university degree and service records to win Senate confirmation in twenty twenty-three.</s> <s>The real test isn't the charge but the direction... whether an anti-graft body can convict a former cabinet member decides if the law bites upward or only downward.</s> <s>Nnaji, now running for governor, is expected to be arraigned within days.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Zimbabwe's president Emmerson Mnangagwa has extended his own term without holding the referendum such a change would normally require.</s> <s>The new law also scraps direct presidential elections altogether, leaving voters to choose only lawmakers, who then pick the leader among themselves.</s> <s>Opposition figure Jacob Ngarivhume calls it rule by a forever president, and so far no one has filed a legal challenge.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Dock workers in Australia are demanding a twenty-eight-hour week at full pay as the operator DP World rolls out automation that a study says threatens sixty percent of their jobs.</s> <s>The Maritime Union's logic is a template for the age of machines... capture the productivity of automation as leisure, rather than let it flow entirely to capital.</s> <s>DP World, whose workers now log thirty-two to thirty-five hours, has yet to respond.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China has issued new rules granting its three hundred million migrant workers access to urban schools and clinics, then handed the trillion-dollar bill to local governments.</s> <s>The reform rewrites the household-registration system that has long shut rural migrants out of city services, but a promise on paper is not a clinic with an open door.</s> <s>Cash-strapped cities now decide whether the rights Beijing decreed ever reach the people it named.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Toyota will move production of its Tacoma pickup from Mexico to Texas over four years, adding two thousand jobs, after a twenty-five percent tariff hit vehicles built south of the border.</s> <s>This shift shows how trade policy is redrawing North America's factory map one model at a time.</s> <s>Washington's trade office now opposes extending the regional pact toward twenty forty-two, deepening the uncertainty for every automaker on the continent.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Germany's Isar Aerospace has signed a one hundred twelve million dollar deal for a dedicated launch pad at Canso in Nova Scotia, paying a Canadian operator nearly four million dollars a quarter.</s> <s>That move gives Europe's most-watched private rocket firm its own gateway to orbit, with a first launch targeted for twenty twenty-eight.</s> <s>The pad must change hands by November of next year, and Isar's only flight so far ended in failure.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>More than two thousand seven hundred people died in France from June's heat, according to attribution scientists who compare the real death toll to a modeled world without human-caused warming.</s> <s>That method sidesteps the chronic undercounting of death certificates, which rarely name heat as the cause.</s> <s>France's June highs already matched what climate models had projected for the twenty seventies, arriving half a century early.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London have designed a candidate vaccine against cytomegalovirus, a common virus that is a leading infectious cause of birth defects and still has no licensed shot.</s> <s>They combined immune-database screening with structural modeling to build a design that binds two key receptors of the body's innate immune system.</s> <s>Simulations predict a strong antibody response, though the candidate still awaits its first test in a living body.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Berlin, scientists found that a single dose of cocaine reshaped the genome architecture of dopamine neurons, with the changes lasting at least two weeks.</s> <s>By mapping how DNA folds inside the cell, they watched one exposure leave a structural mark long after the drug itself was gone.</s> <s>Researcher Ana Pombo calls it a silent injury, one that may prime the brain for a stronger addictive pull the second time.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The European Union now requires every new car to carry an inward-facing camera that watches the driver for signs of distraction.</s> <s>The safety case is real, but mandating an always-on lens in every cabin builds a surveillance surface into private transport by law rather than by choice.</s> <s>Regulators have set no rule yet on who stores that footage, or who can pull it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Microsoft has fired the in-house engine team at id Software, the studio whose code powered Doom for three decades, as part of thirty-two hundred job cuts across Xbox.</s> <s>Gutting a foundational engine team signals a bet on shared, external technology and the steady consolidation of a sprawling studio empire.</s> <s>Four studios are set to leave Xbox for new owners as the restructuring runs through twenty twenty-seven.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>